A '''twisted (-)''' is a [[combat]] [[potions|potion]] that boosts the player's [[Ranged]] and [[Defence]] levels by 4 + 10% of their base levels.

It can only be made in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] with 47 [[Herblore]] by using a [[golpar]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[cicely]] in the inventory.

This potion is the weakest variant of the twisted potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

==Effects==
Ranged boost is calculated with: <math>\lfloor RangedLevel \times \frac{1}{10} \rfloor + 4</math>
